# issue #81 (ranges not folded into nested existential witnesses). Eight
# classes, a range-driven cascade through nested existentials; A ⊑ FINAL is
# entailed by a seven-step derivation and is Konclude's only non-trivial row.
# rustdl emitted ZERO rows on this fixture BEFORE issue #81; since the
# nested-existential range fold it derives A ⊑ FINAL and matches this oracle
# exactly. The instrument still reports Violated on it — a known F1 false
# positive, pinned by acceptance.rs's
# `cascade_now_agrees_with_its_oracle_and_its_violated_is_a_known_f1_false_positive`.
provenance: konclude-v0.7.0-1138
subclass: A FINAL
